                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 702,
                "retweet_count": 31,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "President Trump, Speaker Johnson and Republicans in Congress have refused to address the cost of health care \u2014 but Democrats are united in the fight ahead to ensure premiums don\u2019t skyrocket for the American people.\n\nIt\u2019s time to work together to extend the premium tax credits. https://t.co/1w2D8wPKlF",
