                "reply_count": 307,
                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "24 million Americans are facing skyrocketing premiums if Republicans don't join us to extend the ACA enhanced premium tax credits.\n\nI met with health care providers in New Hampshire to discuss how these tax credits allow Granite Staters to afford the health care they need. https://t.co/6Fwn1G58Cm",
