                "quoted_status_profile_username": "KFF",
                "reply_count": 49,
                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When workers have affordable health insurance, they get healthy and stay healthy which benefits their communities and our economy.\n\n4 million Americans are expected to lose coverage if Republicans allow the ACA tax credits to expire and that shock will be felt by everyone.",
